#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">or</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> plot_ly</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div>I can&#39;t seem to figure out how to set the plot height in plot_ly(). Is the new method documented somewhere or could someone provide an example? If you need a reproducible example to work from let me know. Thanks!</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div>"
